<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese escudo breaks through 100 mark barrier.</title>
<headline>Portuguese escudo breaks through 100 mark barrier.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese escudo broke the psychological barrier of 100 to the mark on Friday to trade at 99.97, traders said.</p>
<p>It was the first time that the currency had firmed below the 100 level since last January.</p>
<p>At 1007 GMT, the currency was trading at 99.97/100.00.</p>
